{
  "format": 1,
  "kind": "skin",
  "name": "Native (built-in)",
  "author": "Native Tribes",
  "notes": [
    "The compiled-in look, written out as a file so it doubles as the reference for authoring.",
    "Selecting the theme named 'default' skips this file entirely and restores the built-in",
    "table directly -- so this can be edited freely without any risk of losing the original.",
    "",
    "Every field is optional. A theme that sets one number keeps the defaults for the rest.",
    "",
    "PALETTE keys: base, baseBottom (widget body gradient), primary, primaryBottom (the",
    "accent-filled button), edge (the stroke and the colour $pref::uiAccentHue rotates),",
    "disabled, disabledEdge. Values are \"#RRGGBB\", \"#RRGGBBAA\", or [r,g,b] / [r,g,b,a] 0-255.",
    "",
    "STYLE fields: cham (chamfer px at a 28px-tall reference widget), corners (bitmask",
    "1=TL 2=TR 4=BR 8=BL), skew, ring (stroke px), ringMode (0 full, 1 brackets, 2 segmented),",
    "seg (bracket arm / segment period), notch, rail, under (underline fraction), bar, scan.",
    "",
    "Style IDs are FIXED -- a theme restyles a row, it cannot add or rename one, because",
    "$pref::uiButtonStyle and the Options picker key on these ids.",
    "bevel defaults to 1: the built-in look is a raised plate, not a flat outline."
  ],
  "palette": {
    "base": "#161D28",
    "baseBottom": "#101620",
    "primary": "#8A3A12",
    "primaryBottom": "#5C2409",
    "edge": "#FF7A3D",
    "disabled": "#12161D",
    "disabledEdge": "#8C96A5",
